{Holding e5 and developing. [%weight 5]} 6. d4
{The break, as everywhere. [%tags d4-break]} 6... exd4 {Black takes. [%weight 7]} 7. e5
{A pawn fork. It hits the bishop on d6 and the knight on f6 at once, and 7...Bxe5 8.Nxe5 leaves nothing on the board to take the knight back. [%tags tactics] [%cal Ge5d6,Ge5f6]}
